





# ============================================================
# CELL 0: Environment & Global Settings
# HASEM v2 — LEAKAGE-SAFE pipeline
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# What is different from the first manuscript run (v1):
#   * every fitted step (gene selection, imputation, scaling, PCA,
#     control limits) uses ONLY the partition it is allowed to see
#   * healthy samples are split 70/15/15 into
#       healthy_train   -> gene selection, imputation, scaling, PCA
#       healthy_calib   -> control limits (thresholds)
#       healthy_holdout -> never used for fitting; final evaluation
#   * tumour samples are never used to fit or calibrate anything
#   * all headline numbers are computed on the evaluation pool only
#     (healthy_holdout + tumours)
# Original parameters (5,000 genes, 99th percentile) are kept on
# purpose, so that the ONLY change versus v1 is the leakage fix.
# ============================================================
